@ShapeFit.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5198
@UserId = 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
@ExerciseId = 4ba85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa7

### Registrar Treino (Com X-Correlation-ID e Idempotência)
POST {{ShapeFit.Api_HostAddress}}/api/workouts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: 7a3b4f5c-8d9e-4f1a-b2c3-d4e5f6a7b8c9

{
  "userId": "{{UserId}}",
  "name": "Treino A - Peito e Tríceps",
  "startedAt": "2026-11-11T14:00:00Z",
  "finishedAt": "2026-11-11T15:00:00Z",
  "clientSyncId": "9b1deb4d-3b7d-4bad-9bdd-2b0d7b3dcb6d",
  "notes": "Treino com progressão de carga",
  "exercises": [
    {
      "exerciseId": "{{ExerciseId}}",
      "order": 1,
      "notes": "Supino reto com barra",
      "sets": [
        {
          "setOrder": 1,
          "type": 1,
          "weight": 80.0,
          "unit": "kg",
          "repetitions": 10,
          "repsInReserve": 2,
          "isCompleted": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

###

### Consultar Última Performance do Exercício (Pré-preenchimento rápido)
GET {{ShapeFit.Api_HostAddress}}/api/workouts/users/{{UserId}}/exercises/{{ExerciseId}}/last-performance
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: 8b4c5d6e-9f0a-5b2c-c3d4-e5f6a7b8c9d0

